[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:The Most Expensive Model]
[00:01.00]Lesson 111 | 第111课
[00:03.63]The most expensive model | 最昂贵的型号
[00:07.30]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 请听录音，然后回答以下问题。
[00:13.04]Can Mr. Frith buy the television on instalments? How does it work? | 弗里斯先生能分期付款买电视吗？具体怎么操作？
[00:22.53]I like this television very much. | 我非常喜欢这台电视机。
[00:26.83]How much does it cost? | 它多少钱？
[00:30.24]It's the most expensive model in the shop. | 这是店里最贵的型号。
[00:34.50]It costs five hundred pounds. | 它要五百英镑。
[00:38.20]That's too expensive for us. | 那对我们来说太贵了。
[00:41.93]We can't afford all that money. | 我们付不起那么多钱。
[00:45.66]This model's less expensive than that one. | 这款型号比那款便宜。
[00:49.75]It's only three hundred pounds. | 它只要三百英镑。
[00:52.88]But, of course, it's not as good as the expensive one. | 但是，当然，它不如那款贵的。
[00:59.51]I don't like this model. | 我不喜欢这款型号。
[01:02.64]The other model's more expensive, but it's worth the money. | 另一款型号更贵，但物有所值。
[01:08.62]Can we buy it on instalments? | 我们可以分期付款买吗？
[01:12.90]Of course. | 当然可以。
[01:14.36]You can pay a deposit of thirty pounds, | 你可以先付三十英镑定金，
[01:18.62]and then fourteen pounds a month for three years. | 然后每月十四英镑，分三年付清。
[01:23.89]Do you like it, dear? | 亲爱的，你喜欢吗？
[01:27.02]I certainly do, but I don't like the price. | 我当然喜欢，但我不喜欢这个价格。
[01:32.40]You always want the best, but we can't afford it. | 你总是想要最好的，但我们负担不起。
[01:38.42]Sometimes you think you're a millionaire! | 有时候你以为自己是百万富翁！
[01:43.66]Millionaires don't buy things on instalments! | 百万富翁可不会分期付款买东西！